# Test data for the Sandbox look camera (Sandbox.LookCamera, Sandbox.LookCameraView).
# Run with --sim-hz 60 --frames-per-tick 2: "tick" here is a frame (1/120 s), and a fixed tick
# runs on even frames, so a message on an odd frame is pending (shown by the frame side) for one
# frame. The file has no tick cuts, so it also replays by time at the default 30 Hz.
